Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Long ago, Gold Roger,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.96,0:00:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,the King of Pirates, obtained\Neverything the world had to offer,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.54,0:00:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and his dying roads drove\Ncountless souls to the seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.90,0:00:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I left everything in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.92,0:00:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.24,0:00:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And thus a new age began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm done playing\Nthrough with the waiting,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.98,0:00:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,either will I'm feeling alive,\Nlook out below, wake up sunshine,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.52,0:00:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.92,0:00:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your flag up high,\Nhail a brand new dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.72,0:00:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Blaze across the sky, time\Nto journey on, on your mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.38,0:00:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Come aboard with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.22,0:00:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on Earth. A legendary!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.16,0:00:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can show your breath?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:00:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll make some waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.86,0:01:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We run our daunted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't no beginners!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.72,0:01:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause if you're wanted,\NThen you're a winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.44,0:01:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,For we are on the cruise!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.98,0:01:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And freedom is the only rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.74,0:01:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fearless night and day!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause that's just our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.88,0:01:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Find one piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.28,0:01:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be the first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.64,0:01:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard it be so bad just at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.46,0:01:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all this real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.02,0:01:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be cause my hand's on a wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.36,0:01:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing, feel it's waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.52,0:01:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,In the world I'm feeling alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.54,0:01:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll be loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.34,0:01:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up sunshine, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.64,0:01:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We have come so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.50,0:01:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta make it to the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.44,0:01:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever danger we find,\Nno one ever left behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.76,0:01:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I've always got your back, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.62,0:01:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sail on shoreward, keep marching forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.54,0:01:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dreaming from the very\Nfirst day I'd make my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.20,0:02:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't you know that\Ndream hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing through with the wave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,In the world I'm feeling\Nalive. Look out below.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.48,0:02:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.48,0:02:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.04,0:02:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up, sunshine, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.34,0:02:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We go?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.88,0:02:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.38,0:02:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,How did a human cut down\None of us in the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.04,0:02:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And not just any fish man but Heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.12,0:02:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Where does that power come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.42,0:03:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it and surround him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.36,0:03:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Take an energy steroid just to be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.94,0:03:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You're screwed now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.36,0:03:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.40,0:03:25.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Neptune's army too!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.98,0:03:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're good!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.60,0:03:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.62,0:03:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as if a wave of\Nmadness Has washed over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.94,0:03:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.90,0:03:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ignore him for now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.10,0:03:45.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill everyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.90,0:03:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.06,0:03:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon the room will be\Ncompletely submerged.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.82,0:03:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Come here and hold on so\Nthat we may flee together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.82,0:04:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, there's something\Nunnatural about their strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.84,0:04:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My army is highly skilled and\Nthey've made quick work of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.40,0:04:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to save my men and\NI have to save my kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.14,0:04:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, you should be able to\Nsecure some air with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.02,0:04:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, good, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.60,0:04:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on to me tightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.98,0:04:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,This may get rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.12,0:04:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.96,0:04:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no more time to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.46,0:04:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro, swim faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.16,0:04:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I only hope that my back doesn't\Ngive out when I need it most.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.66,0:04:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready yourselves, my soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.68,0:04:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall create a path for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.84,0:04:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall retreat to fight another day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.24,0:04:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Merman. Combat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.30,0:04:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.50,0:04:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna need it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.80,0:04:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.40,0:05:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Neptune's up to something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.70,0:05:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.61,0:05:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thoreau!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.08,0:05:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ultramarine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.08,0:05:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All soldiers forward! Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ride the current and retreat\Nfrom the palace! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.04,0:05:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think they'd pull back!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.76,0:05:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.12,0:05:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, take one of these, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.70,0:05:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll fix you right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.34,0:05:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.64,0:05:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.36,0:05:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass through the gate and head inland.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.22,0:05:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta move, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.04,0:05:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.56,0:05:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely there is nothing\Nso terrible as old age.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.84,0:05:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My will is strong, but my\Nbody will not budge an inch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.46,0:06:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Not now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.20,0:06:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The king is injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.66,0:06:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.32,0:06:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hoey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.66,0:06:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We're saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.46,0:06:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I owe you my life, Hoey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.48,0:06:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, darn it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.26,0:06:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even turn my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.90,0:06:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not that old.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.46,0:06:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, Hoey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.40,0:06:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come join us and hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.96,0:06:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.40,0:06:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get a press out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.20,0:06:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.24,0:06:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.00,0:06:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we get snagged on\Nsomething back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.64,0:07:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.18,0:07:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Already grabbed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.44,0:07:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He can't pull away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.84,0:07:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The pirates aren't fleeing either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.76,0:07:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought that swordsman\Ntook care of him already.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.00,0:07:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell is he giving\Nus so much trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.28,0:07:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Minister, let's go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.12,0:07:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, the king could be killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.06,0:07:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to retreat, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.76,0:07:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,All is not lost if you escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.26,0:07:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring my sons and we may see victory yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.20,0:07:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Do as our lord commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.06,0:07:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Both are getting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.06,0:07:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we go after them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.02,0:07:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Let them run. What do we care?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.94,0:07:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Soldiers who can't protect\Ntheir king are no threat to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.40,0:07:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of the king, tie him up\Nin case he gets his strength back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.26,0:08:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I have failed you this time, but so long\Nas my allies live, the battle is not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.96,0:08:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.06,0:08:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the water washed in an old corpse?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.88,0:08:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is the sea forest, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.84,0:08:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I see why you wanted to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.28,0:08:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.60,0:08:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I've wanted to see this place for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.68,0:08:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no idea how much this means.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.72,0:08:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully we can get some\Npeace and quiet here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.02,0:08:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mermaids, ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.00,0:08:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Mermaids, ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.46,0:08:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.74,0:08:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's a Sunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.82,0:09:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.92,0:09:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And I see Franky, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.54,0:09:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.36,0:09:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.36,0:09:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool place, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.34,0:09:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, look who it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.76,0:09:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, is that your new girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.20,0:09:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You always did like to aim big!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.68,0:09:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me introduce you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.56,0:09:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,This here is Crybaby.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.30,0:09:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like a crybaby to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.44,0:09:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, sister, do you\Nlive up to your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.62,0:09:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.48,0:09:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You may call me Shirahoshi if you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.62,0:09:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So, uh, you're the only\None here? Afraid so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.38,0:09:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Robin stopped by earlier, but she\Nhad some Robin business to attend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.94,0:09:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,She went to that big\Nforest of coral over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.42,0:09:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows when she'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.86,0:09:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Jimbae! Awesomeness!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.82,0:09:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're here too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.98,0:10:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so pleased that you made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.24,0:10:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You've grown even stronger\Nthan before. I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.44,0:10:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,People said you couldn't come to town so\NI was afraid I wouldn't get to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.04,0:10:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you came here because\Nyou received my message?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.46,0:10:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What message?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.18,0:10:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't hear anything. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.64,0:10:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Most peculiar.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.98,0:10:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A pleasure to see you, Dean Bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.92,0:10:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been ever so long. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.22,0:10:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What an unexpected meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.78,0:10:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But a welcome one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.82,0:10:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,To what do I owe the...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.42,0:10:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.50,0:10:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you be in the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.26,0:10:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have a sec, Franky?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.06,0:10:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I need some help getting Sanji\Nand Hachi off this shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.10,0:10:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.86,0:10:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.77,0:10:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the octopus guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.78,0:10:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.69,0:10:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you took a beating, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.54,0:10:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Archie! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.06,0:11:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.52,0:11:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.98,0:11:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Scratch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.06,0:11:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing on Fishman Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.28,0:11:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard that Arlong was captured, so\NI assumed you were as well. You...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.78,0:11:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.28,0:11:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.86,0:11:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.94,0:11:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get Sanji, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.78,0:11:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.80,0:11:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.62,0:11:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The mermaid princess at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.28,0:11:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Standing here, I see how\Ninadequate my imagination was.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.74,0:11:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Even with all the colors in my arms, I could\Nnever paint a picture as lovely as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.12,0:11:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh, no blood loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.80,0:11:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He's being annoying,\Nbut also sort of cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.28,0:11:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The old Sanji is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.58,0:11:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Alas, such beauty as yours is\Ntoo fast to fit on any canvas.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.22,0:11:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Every shade in the world\Nis reduced to gray.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.36,0:12:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get it, but who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.42,0:12:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a magical!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.52,0:12:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.98,0:12:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so noisy. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.62,0:12:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What is Princess Shirahoshi doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.26,0:12:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who the hell is that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.14,0:12:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my ship, buddy! Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.58,0:12:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't flip out, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.88,0:12:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy's a shipwright.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.00,0:12:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Tom's brother, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.34,0:12:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,His name's Den.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.58,0:12:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He's doing the recoding.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.20,0:12:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, then why didn't you just say so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.12,0:12:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He lives in the den and he's\Nrecoding your brother for you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.30,0:12:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.21,0:12:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Close enough, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.52,0:12:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean no disrespect, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.16,0:12:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I know why you would come here, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.10,0:12:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.86,0:12:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I kick his ass hard enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.72,0:12:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How many of these is he going to throw?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.88,0:12:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over it, man. What a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.94,0:12:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you thinking, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.30,0:12:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The princess could have been killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.12,0:13:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, have a little faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.18,0:13:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got me to save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.98,0:13:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.48,0:13:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.46,0:13:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's the grave she\Nwanted to see so bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.12,0:13:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,She's been at this an awful long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.86,0:13:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That is her mother's grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.56,0:13:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,A monument to Queen Otohime.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.08,0:13:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Vanderdecken's relentless pursuit began\Nright after the death of the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.68,0:13:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Shirahoshi was denied\Nany chance at closure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.70,0:13:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And even worse, she was unable\Nto attend her mother's funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.32,0:13:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She spent every day since\Nlocked in the hardshell tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.50,0:13:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that over the\Nyears, all the things she
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.92,0:14:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,wanted to tell her mother\NKept piling up in her heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.80,0:14:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.58,0:14:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.34,0:14:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami! Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.72,0:14:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.26,0:14:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Hirohoshi is here too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.48,0:14:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.39,0:14:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You ever have that banquet, or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.30,0:14:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this one!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.40,0:14:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He's okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.64,0:14:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hatchan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.55,0:14:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What in the world happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.14,0:14:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, Kuma...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.64,0:14:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hardy did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.82,0:14:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what it's come to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.44,0:14:43.64,Default,,0,0,0,,To think that they were even\Nable to infiltrate the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.72,0:14:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,this is a dire situation indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.58,0:14:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What about everyone else\Nthey're not hurt are
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.10,0:14:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,they i hope not but let's\Nhurry back just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.08,0:14:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Things got worse my father\Nno how could they do
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.82,0:14:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,such a thing to him to\Nsuch a kind and gentle man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.64,0:15:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I failed you luffy i left you that message
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.98,0:15:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,to avoid a fight like\Nthis i didn't want to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.68,0:15:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,get You dragged into\Nour struggles yet here
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.26,0:15:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,we are it's even worse than i ever feared.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.58,0:15:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We must make haste but humor me for\Na moment there is something i should
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.16,0:15:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,have told luffy two Years ago when\Nwe first met though it means even
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.54,0:15:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,more now i owe a debt of gratitude to\Nthe people Who stopped our long from
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.80,0:15:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,running wild in the east blue he had\Ndone more than enough harm already.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.50,0:15:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand that it was\Nyou who defeated him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.56,0:15:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,so i express a long\Noverdue thank you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.42,0:15:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And though it pains me i must apologize
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.34,0:15:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,as well don't say it 11 years ago Our lung
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.32,0:16:01.97,Default,,0,0,0,,was locked away by the government and\Neven knowing what evils he was capable of
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.08,0:16:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I freed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.38,0:16:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.14,0:16:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about King\NNeptune? Don't look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.30,0:16:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The king's giving us a chance\Nto make it out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.40,0:16:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The exit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.82,0:16:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.90,0:16:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate the coral!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.18,0:17:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That didn't go well at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.24,0:17:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Few guards have skipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.50,0:17:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,King Neptune sacrificed himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.78,0:17:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And we have nothing to show from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.68,0:17:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.74,0:17:09.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, quit their whining.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.00,0:17:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We followed his orders plain and simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.18,0:17:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.12,0:17:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is by no means a repeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.82,0:17:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll save the king, take\Nback the Ryugu palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And eradicate that\Npirate scum in due time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.26,0:17:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But first off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.32,0:17:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to contact Prince Spook\Nof Oshie and his brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.92,0:17:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Find the princess as soon as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.82,0:17:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.73,0:17:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,After that, we'll start regrouping.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.72,0:17:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And make our way back to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.14,0:17:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we're down the closest\Nto where we are now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.62,0:17:36.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Fishfurley Hills, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.60,0:17:38.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.22,0:17:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, in the high-class\Ndistrict of Fishfurley Hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.78,0:17:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.04,0:17:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Get in the line now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.72,0:17:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll do it if you know\Nwhat's good for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.70,0:17:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.16,0:17:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want from us? Stomp it. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.08,0:17:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a test. But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.06,0:17:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Do as we say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.46,0:18:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't be long before\NHorde rules this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.38,0:18:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, step on the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.12,0:18:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But you can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.92,0:18:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.64,0:18:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,At Candy Factory Town in the Northeast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.06,0:18:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, put your foot down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.76,0:18:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.38,0:18:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.92,0:18:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't tread on her image.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.28,0:18:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.92,0:18:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.10,0:18:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who will follow our orders will\Nbe branded as human sympathizers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.24,0:18:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means you'll also\Nbe your enemy in the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.56,0:18:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,southeast outside the\Nfish man culture hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.66,0:18:52.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make it easy for you. Step on the\Npitcher or get ready to leave the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.52,0:18:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.58,0:18:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That ain't happening
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.34,0:18:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.28,0:18:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This guy can't be that tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.08,0:19:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just step on the pitcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.72,0:19:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone who doesn't wanna...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.74,0:19:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,...is gonna get sliced up real good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.64,0:19:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,At the Marine shopping mall in the East.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.14,0:19:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, leave the country?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.76,0:19:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our home!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.94,0:19:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.96,0:19:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No other place on the\Nsea floor gets light!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.86,0:19:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, you're fishmen too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.72,0:19:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes you think\Nhumans will accept us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.02,0:19:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.48,0:19:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You already know how easily\Nhumans will discriminate
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.20,0:19:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,against anything that's\Ndifferent from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.18,0:19:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what in the heck is\Nhappening to you, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.18,0:19:41.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He's being choked!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.50,0:19:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way that humans and\Nfishmen will ever coexist peacefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.90,0:19:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Your best bet is to accept\Nthe rule of boarding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.42,0:19:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Under his reign, we'll have\Nthe power to change history.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.10,0:19:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,At Waterwheeltown in the north.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.12,0:20:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I think it's your\Nturn. It'll be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.58,0:20:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.64,0:20:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You still haven't stepped on it yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.08,0:20:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what good are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.84,0:20:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, aren't you... Fukaboshi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.86,0:20:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.38,0:20:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.54,0:20:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You scum, how dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.28,0:20:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Forcing people to tread on\Nthe image of my late mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.62,0:20:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,At Coral Hill, after the departure\Nof Luffy and the others...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.88,0:20:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.86,0:20:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing we can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.06,0:20:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right, we let Vanderdekin escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.14,0:20:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And before that,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.28,0:20:51.28,Default,,0,0,0,,we couldn't stop the Straw Hats\Nfrom kidnapping Princess Shirahoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.70,0:20:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't the princess say she'd\Nbe back home in time for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.52,0:20:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.43,0:20:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,They made her say that so we\Nwouldn't chase after them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.98,0:21:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a group from the Fishman District\Nthat's terrorizing the entire island.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.86,0:21:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.77,0:21:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, did they say what's\Nhappening over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.78,0:21:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.42,0:21:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They said that mermaids are\Nbeing reported missing all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.48,0:21:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess Shura Hachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.70,0:21:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,They wouldn't sell her to the\NCelestial Dragons, would they?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.76,0:21:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, awful news.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.62,0:21:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like another mermaid\Ngirl just went missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.54,0:21:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.38,0:21:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Form a search party!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.44,0:21:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Got another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.86,0:21:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knew it would be this easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.92,0:21:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, I've just got to\Nget my hands on that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.54,0:21:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the biggest mermaid I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.28,0:21:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If a human-sized mermaid\Ncan net me 70 million,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.64,0:21:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,then a mermaid that's ten times that size\Nis bound to bring in an even greater haul.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.14,0:21:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a mermaid motherlode.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.06,0:21:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Any way you slice it, I'll make a fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.78,0:21:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.30,0:21:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.94,0:21:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.90,0:22:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,please
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.48,0:22:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,princess do not worry Heart
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.14,0:22:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,may have seized control of\Nthe palace but King Neptune
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.92,0:22:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,will not give in so easily\Nyour father is tougher than you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.18,0:22:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,realize I do still I will help
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.36,0:22:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,save the king at any cost Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.84,0:22:27.06,Default,,0,0,0,,well, thank you, Team Bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.40,0:22:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.94,0:22:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, please excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.96,0:22:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a matter to discuss\Nwith Luffy and his crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.38,0:22:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Beautiful ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.06,0:22:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please have some tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.80,0:22:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever, just leave it\Nover there for right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.42,0:22:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you've bothered us enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.40,0:22:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We're having a serious talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.38,0:22:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so sexy when you're\Nstirred with me, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.46,0:22:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanchi-Chan hasn't changed one bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.80,0:22:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.12,0:22:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot, that's not for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.46,0:22:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.42,0:23:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.68,0:23:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's settle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.48,0:23:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what did you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.64,0:23:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Earlier, you said you set\NArlong loose into the East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.28,0:23:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.19,0:23:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.62,0:23:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.00,0:23:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard the same thing. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.42,0:23:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, a while back,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.74,0:23:28.14,Default,,0,0,0,,When Luffy and I first learned\Nabout Jinbe of the Seven Warlords,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.22,0:23:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yosaku told us about the\Nbargain that Jinbe struck.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.52,0:23:32.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a warlord.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.82,0:23:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,In exchange for becoming one of the Seven,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.40,0:23:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinbe let a dangerous fish\Nman run wild in the East Blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.44,0:23:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, is that what he told us?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.58,0:23:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Surprise, surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.02,0:23:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.48,0:23:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how Yosaku is doing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.10,0:23:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Two years ago, when I read about you\Nassociating with Jinbe in the newspaper,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.38,0:23:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,However, I honestly didn't\Nknow what to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.14,0:23:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Jinbe had been\Nthe key figure pulling
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.90,0:24:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Arlong's strings and\Ntelling him what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.38,0:24:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Jinbe,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.30,0:24:09.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you a chance to defend what\Nhappened, but choose your words wisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.44,0:24:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,After all,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.78,0:24:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,our very own navigator here had her entire\Nlife ruined thanks to your buddy Arlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.48,0:24:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,To put it simply, whatever you did\Nturned her world into a living hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.52,0:24:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Depending on what you have to\Nsay, I might not forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.62,0:24:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful, Hedgen!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.94,0:24:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.16,0:24:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Your wounds could open up again!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.00,0:24:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.96,0:24:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We caused her so much grief!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.66,0:24:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.22,0:24:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And all the apologizing in the\Nworld won't change a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.08,0:25:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to guide ships around\Nall the oceans of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.66,0:25:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be great!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.84,0:25:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, I can make maps of\Nall the furthest places I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.22,0:25:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This map's the first step\Nto realizing your dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.34,0:25:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that about right? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.40,0:25:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami, Nojiko, none of\Nus are actually related.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.12,0:25:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't mean we're not a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.36,0:25:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? Pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.18,0:25:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Pirates are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.84,0:25:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody run!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.88,0:25:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Greetings and salutations,\Nyou pathetic little humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.66,0:25:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This village is now mine! Now wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.80,0:25:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.71,0:25:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Better yet, I'll take this whole island!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.18,0:26:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,100,000 fairies for adults,\Nand 50,000 for children.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.40,0:26:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who cannot pay, die.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.88,0:26:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.78,0:26:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough, Jitsad.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.02,0:26:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now get ready to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.68,0:26:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Nojiko! Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.48,0:26:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.88,0:26:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.26,0:26:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A map, huh? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.34,0:26:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my map!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.40,0:26:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I drew it and you can't have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.14,0:26:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,A child drew this? Look at that! Abby, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.20,0:27:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed. Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.36,0:27:03.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She could be useful.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.72,0:27:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring her with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.96,0:27:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.10,0:27:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.01,0:27:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.76,0:27:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody please help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.38,0:27:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If humans want to eat, they have to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.06,0:27:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be a good girl and keep drawing maps.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.06,0:27:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather up 100 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.20,0:27:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Then bring it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.32,0:27:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Do so and I will let your village go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.60,0:27:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,In addition to giving you your freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.06,0:27:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Get that thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.72,0:27:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She's got our treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.26,0:27:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever see just a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.90,0:27:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care, shoot her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.78,0:27:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Crap, find her. Run.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.70,0:27:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,70 million. Only 70\Nmillion more will be free?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.02,0:28:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh so you made it back after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.54,0:28:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you had nowhere else to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.72,0:28:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, welcome back, navigator.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.78,0:28:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, you had a\Ntruly horrific experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.30,0:28:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, and she has you to think.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.68,0:28:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.30,0:28:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.52,0:28:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing will ever make me change\Nthe way I feel about Arlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.08,0:28:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, until two years ago,\Nwhen we made the trip to Sabo Odi,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.46,0:28:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no idea that even the strongest of
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.12,0:28:52.72,Default,,0,0,0,,fishmen were routinely\Npersecuted by humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.46,0:28:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,When Kuma was kidnapped and we tried to\Nsave her, I couldn't believe what I saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.64,0:29:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,There was Sabo Odi Park,\Nright in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.68,0:29:08.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The spitting image of Arlong\NPark before it was destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.48,0:29:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We wanted a
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.86,0:29:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,place all our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.96,0:29:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not saying this to\Nmake you forgive any of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.30,0:29:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.44,0:29:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.68,0:29:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Arlong, he really hated humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.86,0:29:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.12,0:29:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we went too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.30,0:29:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But for as long as I can remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.78,0:29:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,we yearned for the world that the\Nhumans lived in, above. the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.82,0:29:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Arlong, me, all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.46,0:30:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My people weren't considered anything\Nmore than fish way back when.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.96,0:30:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Then,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.90,0:30:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,200 years ago, the Ryugu Kingdom became\Na member country of the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.52,0:30:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,They established friendly\Nrelations with humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.00,0:30:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,and their king was even allowed to\Nparticipate in the world's summit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.06,0:30:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But, despite that, humans\Nstill had hate in their hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.68,0:30:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The beginning of the Great Pirate Era\Nwas probably the worst time in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.04,0:30:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It was hard to be a fish man.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.42,0:30:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I vividly remember my fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.68,0:30:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Human pirates running wild on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.32,0:30:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Anywhere you went seemed dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.86,0:30:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So much violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.54,0:31:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.38,0:31:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Our only safe place in the\Nworld was taken over by humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.24,0:31:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Then came that fateful day.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.00,0:31:15.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard arrived on\Nthe island and saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.74,0:31:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He made his powerful presence felt,\Nclaiming Fishman Island as his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.92,0:31:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of him, peace\Nreturned to our home.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.26,0:31:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,However, humans continue to\Nbe prejudiced towards fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.50,0:31:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you saw it first hand\Nat the Sabo Odin Archipelago.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.48,0:31:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the cruel reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.60,0:31:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally, once someone attains power,\Nthey tend to be resisted to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.62,0:31:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though the government theoretically\Nbridged the gap between fishmen and humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.08,0:31:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The worst bigots were\Nthe people in control.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.06,0:31:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,begin with the ones who\Nshould be leading by example
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.24,0:32:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,thus the relationship\Nbetween fish man and humans
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.44,0:32:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,remained the same\Nthankfully two individuals
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.18,0:32:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,rose up on fishman island individuals who
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.30,0:32:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,would help change the\Ncourse of our beleaguered
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.42,0:32:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,history the first was
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.32,0:32:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,queen otohime she believed
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.64,0:32:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,we islanders could live\Nin harmony with humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.76,0:32:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She was Princess Shirohoshi's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.96,0:32:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Then there was him, the legendary\Nhero named Fisher Tiger,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.52,0:32:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,who freed countless slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.68,0:32:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That tiger guy, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.22,0:32:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I've heard the name before.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.14,0:32:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,To set himself apart from the humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.76,0:32:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Tiger broke an unspoken rule,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.58,0:32:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,invading the holy land of Marie Joie by\Nhimself and freeing the slaves within.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.10,0:32:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He would go on to form the Sun Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.76,0:32:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Many of its members were fishmen who\Nwere formerly slaves of the nobles.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.00,0:32:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sun Pirates? Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.90,0:33:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You know them as Arlong,\NHachi, and myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.82,0:33:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The three of us were part of the\Nvery first crew of the Sun Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.62,0:33:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But we were known as Fishman Pirates,\Nfoes of the world government.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.20,0:33:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all that they saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.02,0:33:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, we made it that much\Nmore difficult for Queen Otohime.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.92,0:33:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Bless her heart, our existence\Nprevented much progress.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.22,0:33:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Queen Otohime was trying to navigate\Ngreat hardships and improve our future.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.30,0:33:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,At the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.30,0:33:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Fisher Tiger threw his future away to save
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.70,0:33:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,those of his race who\Nwere suffering as slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.38,0:33:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can say who was right or wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.30,0:33:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nevertheless, they both fought for a\Nbetter future for fishmen and humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.82,0:33:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Each one is a legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.70,0:34:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And both of their tales end in tragedy.
